Spacecraft Constellation Fault Simulator
A comprehensive GUI-based spacecraft constellation simulator built on the Basilisk astrodynamics framework. This simulator enables the modeling of multi-satellite constellations with advanced cluster management, machine learning-based fault detection, deep reinforcement learning task reassignment, and 3D visualization via Vizard.

